WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.550
In March 2021, Parliament passed Bill C-7.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:12.675
This legislation officially removed the requirement that a person's death must be reasonably foreseeable in order to qualify for MAID.

00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:21.612
This established what is known as 'Track Two', legally permitting individuals with non-terminal disabilities and chronic illnesses to receive MAID.
